name="us-gaap:WarrantsAndRightsOutstandingMeasurementInput" scale="0" id="Narr_GUiJ9uzh5U6zZosMtVLy0g">5</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="background:#ffffff;"> years; equity volatility of&#160;</span><span style="background:#ffffff;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_UUdnucBy-ESLbxBuD3haHA" contextRef="As_Of_2_24_2026_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_xwel_SeriesHPlacementAgentWarrantsMember_us-gaap_MeasurementInputTypeAxis_us-gaap_MeasurementInputPriceVolatilityMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xwel_PrivatePlacementTrancheTwoMember_SWWUcpvUZUWFfa8h449GCw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:WarrantsAndRightsOutstandingMeasurementInput" scale="0" id="Narr_eLvIN343vUignYZObCLH0g">100</ix:nonFraction>%</span><span style="background:#ffffff;">; and a risk-free interest rate of&#160;</span><span style="background:#ffffff;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_UUdnucBy-ESLbxBuD3haHA" contextRef="As_Of_2_24_2026_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_xwel_SeriesHPlacementAgentWarrantsMember_us-gaap_MeasurementInputTypeAxis_us-gaap_MeasurementInputRiskFreeInterestRateMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xwel_PrivatePlacementTrancheTwoMember_YPTXF63ZyE2FoiWCG4e-XA" decimals="1" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:WarrantsAndRightsOutstandingMeasurementInput" scale="0" id="Narr_lzMPCf9ZEkm6csaeNakN5A">3.6</ix:nonFraction>%</span><span style="background:#ffffff;">.</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">Transaction costs totaling $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_Iqt2ShexkkuKWrJsYBo3hw" contextRef="Duration_2_24_2026_To_2_24_2026_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xwel_February2026PrivatePlacementMember_ZHN72PB_zUauFRQXL91IaA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:PaymentsOfStockIssuanceCosts" scale="3" id="Narr_1Fqi1jPqB0GlpPqZ-N4YWQ">10,216</ix:nonFraction>&#160;were incurred related to the February 2026 Private Placement consisting of cash expenses for placement agent fees, legal fees, and accounting costs related to the financing, as well as the fair value of Series H Placement Agent Warrants. Net proceeds from the February 2026 Private Placement totaled $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_Iqt2ShexkkuKWrJsYBo3hw" contextRef="Duration_2_24_2026_To_2_24_2026_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_xwel_February2026PrivatePlacementMember_ZHN72PB_zUauFRQXL91IaA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromIssuanceOfPrivatePlacement" scale="3" id="Narr_l6jWyFDn_06M5hB6P435Cg">28,269</ix:nonFraction>. As the Series H Preferred Stock and Series H Warrants were classified in permanent equity, all transaction costs were recorded as an offset to additional paid-in capital.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><i style="font-style:italic;">February 2026 Omnibus Agreement</i></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">On February 24, 2026, the Company entered into the Omnibus Agreement, by and between the Company and January 2025 Investors, pursuant to which, the Company agreed to (i) repurchase from the January 2025 Investors $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_Iqt2ShexkkuKWrJsYBo3hw" contextRef="As_Of_2_24_2026_bDIXdjUYj0OA58YnZbrcGA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xwel:DebtInstrumentConvertibleAggregateAmountRepurchased" scale="3" id="Narr_-LeUK2gzSkqwqS-